{"id":"69cf8a2e13927557","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-nonacceptable-numbering.md","title":"有效满编号仍可能不可接受","display":"ex-nonacceptable-numbering — 有效满编号仍可能不可接受","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-nonacceptable-numbering","aliases":["20-ex-nonacceptable-numbering"],"display":"ex-nonacceptable-numbering — 有效满编号仍可能不可接受","chapter":"1","section":"1.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 1.7.9","source_printed_pages":[22],"source_pdf_pages":[58],"depends_on":["[[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-nonacceptable-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-nonacceptable-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-nonacceptable-numbering — 有效满编号仍可能不可接受"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 1.7.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>22</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c21e5e4663b12909\" href=\"?note=c21e5e4663b12909\" title=\"20-df-acceptable-numbering\">20-df-acceptable-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q,x\\in\\omega\">\\(p,q,x\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_{\\langle p,q\\rangle}\">\\(\\psi_{\\langle p,q\\rangle}\\)</span> 由下式引入。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c21e5e4663b12909\" href=\"?note=c21e5e4663b12909\" title=\"20-df-acceptable-numbering\">20-df-acceptable-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonacceptable\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\psi_{\\langle p,q\\rangle}(x)\\simeq\\begin{cases}p-1&amp;x=0\\land p&gt;0,\\\\ \\uparrow&amp;x=0\\land p=0,\\\\ \\varphi_q(x)&amp;x&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\\\ \\{\\psi_e:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_1,\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\psi).\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonacceptable\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\psi_{\\langle p,q\\rangle}(x)\\simeq\\begin{cases}p-1&amp;x=0\\land p&gt;0,\\\\ \\uparrow&amp;x=0\\land p=0,\\\\ \\varphi_q(x)&amp;x&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\\\ \\{\\psi_e:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_1,\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\psi).\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>联合求值是部分可计算；任意 φ_q 按其 0 点发散或输出 c 选择 p=0 或 p=c+1，所以此编号满射。若存在全可计算 g 使 ψ_g(e)=φ_e，则由 g(e) 的第一配对坐标是否为 0 判定 φ_e(0) 是否停止。s-m-n 将对角停机编译到输入 0，矛盾。满射论证只用存在性选择 p，不声称能有效从 q 得到 p。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 1.7.9；印刷页 22；PDF 第 58 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c21e5e4663b12909","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c21e5e4663b12909","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,q,x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_{\\langle p,q\\rangle}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonacceptable\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\psi_{\\langle p,q\\rangle}(x)\\simeq\\begin{cases}p-1&x=0\\land p>0,\\\\ \\uparrow&x=0\\land p=0,\\\\ \\varphi_q(x)&x>0,\\end{cases}\\\\ \\{\\psi_e:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_1,\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\psi).\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1696,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c21e5e4663b12909","35073b74f84433b3","8ba6597a854c206f","d18ba716e49ac8c6","e343870c773cb68e"]}